00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u262a\ufe0f", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToZ3Fo4S", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 18, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8928924, "raw_content": "Being in the corporate grind for decades as a technical professional and dealing with incompetent management, downsizings, being overlooked for jobs and promotions due to DEI, and always being the top performer in each group I'm in while not being rewarded for it, am thinking about bailing.  \n\nAlso, it seems that nearly all of my colleagues have been on the left and they can talks politics all the want, without repercussion, but that freedom of expression is not extended to people with other views.\n\nHave any of you decided to move on from corporate type jobs or done a career change in middle age or beyond?  If so, what did you end up going?  I'm at the point where I'm considering more menial or manual labor type jobs although am probably too old to do a trade at this point (pushing 50).\n\n", "author": "mav7579", "created": 1794068434293, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Stanwyk74", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Have any of you given up on the corporate grind?", "last_comment_created": 1794076961714, "content": "<p>Being in the corporate grind for decades as a technical professional and dealing with incompetent management, downsizings, being overlooked for jobs and promotions due to DEI, and always being the top performer in each group I'm in while not being rewarded for it, am thinking about bailing.</p>\n<p>Also, it seems that nearly all of my colleagues have been on the left and they can talks politics all the want, without repercussion, but that freedom of expression is not extended to people with other views.</p>\n<p>Have any of you decided to move on from corporate type jobs or done a career change in middle age or beyond?  If so, what did you end up going?  I'm at the point where I'm considering more menial or manual labor type jobs although am probably too old to do a trade at this point (pushing 50).</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 35, "score_up": 18, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToZ3Fo4O", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 18, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8928920, "raw_content": "welcome in America, and voters in both parties want them gone.\nWith Stephen Miller as the new Chief of Staff, we are watching who he add to his team. Gregory K Bovino and Bo French would be good start.\nIf the H1B, H4, and/or OPT programs re not ended this year, the Democrats will sweep 2028. This will lead to the Civil War that everyone wanted. ", "author": "Tomis_4", "created": 1794068381500, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Deplora", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "President Trump's inner circle (Don Jr., Jared, Elon, Susie, Levin and many CEOs) told him to not end the H1B, H4, OPT visas, and they will help him win the midterm and 2028. They did spend hundreds of millions of dollars and still lost! They do not have the voting power! Indians are no longer ", "last_comment_created": 1794069119019, "content": "<p>welcome in America, and voters in both parties want them gone.\nWith Stephen Miller as the new Chief of Staff, we are watching who he add to his team. Gregory K Bovino and Bo French would be good start.\nIf the H1B, H4, and/or OPT programs re not ended this year, the Democrats will sweep 2028. This will lead to the Civil War that everyone wanted.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 18, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToZ3DbgA", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 210, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "pence", "id": 8928122, "raw_content": "", "author": "SpitFireX", "created": 1794020130241, "profile_picture": "enpKCbnFZWRw", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "FREN", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToZ3DbgA.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/RaeMZsWxkPJS.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/56vFgPptjkTKfGMz.jpeg", "width": 500, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 562}], "blurhash": "U19suH:O56-,krfkV?E1]}}EMxKzIoDO0gFy", "full_resolution": [562, 500]}, "title": "You don't need to sell him to me", "last_comment_created": 1794020815572, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author